 ftest1 | ftest2 | ftest3 | ftest4 
--------+--------+--------+--------
        |      2 |      3 |      2
      2 |        |      3 |      3
        |      2 |      7 |      4
        |      3 |      4 |      5
(4 rows)

-- Try to delete something that should not have a cascade
